 """Safely relocate earlier per-treatment IBM files out of analysis-only folder.

 Never overwrite an existing record; move the whole legacy treatment directory
 only when the corresponding destination does not already exist.
 """
 raise RuntimeError('Historical record migration is disabled; preserve original records')
